{NameDateMay 2, 2025TitleUPDATE 12 ğŸ€Imagerbxassetid://124226587911037Codepatchnotes_cosmetics2ChangesscriptğŸ”« NEW WEAPONDescriptionThe Jump Pad is here!\Find all of the Jump Shards hidden all over the game (RIVALS) to earn the Jump Pad for FREE!NThe Jump Pad can NOT be purchased or obtained in any other way, happy hunting!CJump Pad's brand new Trampoline Skin can be found in the Skin Case!CJump Pad's brand new Bounce House Skin can be found in Skin Case 2!âœ¨ GAMEMODELimitless Loadout is here!bDuel your enemies in this mode where you get to equip any weapon in any slot, any amount of times!UEquip 4 RPGs, try using a double Scythe loadout, and much more! The freedom is yours!,This new mode can be found in the Play page!AHere for a limited time only and available in 1v1s, 2v2s, & 3v3s!ğŸ€ COSMETICS·There's a brand new cosmetic rarity â€” Mythicals! Only the best and most prestigious cosmetics will receive this rarity, starting off with ALL key-themed skins & the Crystal Daggers!§Everyone who completed The Hunt: Mega Edition have been given FREE charms to remember the event! Players that obtained the Mega Token have also received a bonus charm!œThe brand new Legendary Bubbles Wrap can now be obtained by gifting other players! The more gifts you send to other players, the more Bubbles Wraps you get!FNEW Applino Charm â€” Eliminate @RealApplino for this brand new charm!<NEW 8sty Charm â€” Eliminate @8sty for this brand new charm!ğŸ“† DAILY TASK STREAKSHYou can now earn a Task Streak by completing your Daily Tasks every day!cOnce you have a Task Streak, you'll gain bonus rewards the next time you complete your Daily Tasks!„If you're able to keep your Task Streak up for long enough, you'll eventually earn the brand new, animated, Mythical Celestial Wrap!BTask Streaks can NOT be recovered â€” make sure you don't lose it!NThe Legendary Supernova Wrap is now twice as likely to drop from a daily task!ğŸŠ SKIN CASE 3A BRAND NEW SKIN CASE IS HERE!6Contains brand new skins for most weapons in the game!Now available in the Shop!ğŸ”¥ SKIN CASE 2&Skin Case 2 has received 11 new skins!¤Contains brand new skins for Energy Rifle, Energy Pistols, Crossbow, Daggers, Riot Shield, Satchel, War Horn, Battle Axe, Spray, Gunblade, & the brand new Jump Pad!ğŸ“¦ WRAP BOX 3A BRAND NEW WRAP BOX IS HERE!aContains dozens of brand new wraps, including the brand new, animated, Mythical Neon Lights Wrap!ğŸ’¥ FINISHER PACK 2"A BRAND NEW FINISHER PACK IS HERE!@Contains dozens of brand finishers, now at a much cheaper price!ğŸš€ RPG BUNDLEA BRAND NEW BUNDLE IS HERE!–Contains the RPG, the exclusive Pencil RPG Skin, the exclusive Cardboard Wrap, the exclusive Emoji: Nerd Charm, the exclusive Erased Finisher, & more!	ğŸ›’ SHOPNYou can now find the brand new, animated, Mythical Solar Wrap in the Wrap Box!LYou can now find the brand new, animated, Mythical Speed Wrap in Wrap Box 2!9Wrap Box 2 now also contains the Legendary Hologram Wrap!SAll Key Bundles in the Shop may now contain the brand new Skin Case 3 & Wrap Box 3!…The Wealth and Lucre wraps from the high tier Key Bundles have been retired and replaced with the brand new Legendary Luxurious Wrap!TThe original Finisher Pack has been permanently discounted! Enjoy the cheaper price!QThe Simulation Wrap has been replaced by the new Messis and Sunset Sparkle wraps!ğŸ† RANKEDLThere have been a lot of changes made to Ranked. Let's get straight into it!ÃPlayers that are ranked Platinum 1 or higher now no longer receive Daily ELO Shields. This feature was intended to encourage newer players to play Ranked and serves no purpose in the higher ranksüDefault weapons are now bannable if everyone in the duel owns more than 4 weapons in each slot. We want to promote loadout diversity in Ranked and we only expect top players (whom should be comfortable playing all weapons) to be affected by this changeºIt's evident that so far during Season 0, ELO gain/loss calculations have not been the best. On top of that, there were matchmaking issues that impacted the integrity of the Ranked sceneàSeason 0 is still here and still experimental. However, ELO calculations have been greatly improved with this update, and so has matchmaking. You should be paired against enemies of equal skill much more often. If you were to be put up against an unfair match, you can rest easy knowing that your ELO will only take a miniscule hit if you were to lose.‰We've also introduced ELO Decay â€” Players ranked Onyx 1 or higher are now required to play atleast 1 Ranked game every 7 days to avoid ELO Decay. Inactive players will lose 100 ELO per day until they start playing Ranked again or until they hit the bottom of Onyx«Due to all of these changes and due to the how unfair ELO progression & matchmaking was during the first phase of Season 0, all players with an ELO of 3,400+ have been reset back down to 3,400. ELO Resets are not something we expect to do again, especially after this experimental Season 0 concludesÚAll players affected by this ELO Reset have been given an exclusive "I Survived Season 0" Charm as compensation. Players that were on the ELO Leaderboard will have their final rank placement engraved onto their charms!·That's not all though... there's a brand new top rank. Archnemesis is here and only available to the top 200 Nemesis players worldwide. Do you have what it takes to be an Archnemesis?ğŸ”« BALANCE CHANGESHeaderEnergy RifleRğŸ“ "The previous Energy Rifle changes reduced it's effective damage by too much")ğŸ’ª Body damage increased from 15 â†’ 20GunbladesğŸ“ "Gunblade has been reworked to allow us to specifically nerf the damage the blade deals when you have no ammo"*ğŸ”» Blade damage decreased from 50 â†’ 35$â– Max Ammo increased from 8 â†’ 12ªâ– Blade attacks now shoot enemies when you land a hit, consuming 1 ammo and dealing an extra 15 critical damage. This bonus damage is not applied if you run out of ammoSniperKğŸ“ "The Sniper should be a weapon that's all about landing precise shots")ğŸ”» Body damage decreased from 70 â†’ 50HandgunnğŸ“ "Handgun has lacked an identity, so it's now shifting into the role of being an excellent cleanup weapon";ğŸ’ª Equip cooldown has been decreased from 0.45s â†’ 0.13s	Flare GunOğŸ“ "The previous Flare Gun changes reduced it's effective damage by too much"*ğŸ’ª DPS has been increased from 25 â†’ 40Chainsaw]ğŸ“ "We want to enable players to be able to quickly reposition with the Chainsaw's ability":ğŸ’ª Equip cooldown has been decreased from 1.13s â†’ 0.6s
ğŸ›  OTHER©Double jumping while airborne now allows you to instantly redirect your momentum! For example, you can now instantly turn around while rocket jumping if you double jump!BThe all-time highest ever win streaks leaderboard has been removed-You can now open up to x100 lootboxes at once>The Flare Gun has received a completely new set of animations!@The chocolate chips on the Milk & Cookies skin are now wrappable%Improved sights for the Exogourd skin,Improved wrap groups for the Aqua Burst skin&Improved spawns for the Big Splash mapğŸ› BUG FIXESFixed a visual bug that caused players to be permanently stuck in crouch mode. This fix should also patch the majority of "head glitch" strategies in all mapsÚFixed a bug that caused Sniper eliminations & damage dealt to be considered as noscopes. Sniper noscope statistics have been reset back to 0 as a result of this bug fix since they didn't mean anything prior to this fixHFixed a visual bug when aiming with the Sniper in first person on mobileBFixed a bug where 1v1v1 and 2v2v2 modes didn't start in Big SplashbFixed a visual bug where there was a gap between the wall and window on the blue building in DocksSFixed a visual bug where the top part of the crane wasn't connected in ConstructionXFixed a bug in Big Backrooms where players clipped into walls during the end game screen[Fixed a bug where jumping off the Shooting Range map during a duel instantly eliminated youeFixed a spawn in Big Graveyard that spawned players inside a wall in Free For All and Team Deathmatch7Fixed many out of bounds hiding spots in Big Crossroads"Fixed many hiding spots in StationDFixed a bug in Legacy Onyx where projectiles bounced off of the lavaTFixed a bug in Onyx and Big Onyx where players could clip under the lava with TrowelZFixed a bug in Graveyard and Big Graveyard where players could hide past the barrier wallsRFixed collision issues and exposed holes in terrain on Graveyard and Big Graveyard4Fixed gate collisions in Graveyard and Big GraveyardğŸ“œ A NOTE FROM THE DEVELOPERS1We hope you all enjoy yet another update from us!¸Just want to quickly address the Ranked ELO Reset â€” it was a tough decision to make but we need to keep experimenting to improve the Ranked experience. Our long term goal is to get Ranked as perfect as possible before we release Season 1 & all of the rewards associated with Ranked. We hope you all understand!ìIn the future, we will allow players to see their Ranked statistics from previous seasons, including what your ELO & leaderboard ranking was before this specific ELO Reset. So don't worry, your previous ELO hasn't been completely wiped.zOur next update is going to be a lot of fun, much more than any update we've ever released! Stay tuned for more details...␀␀␀
